{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>A hairy goat.</b> Its blood resembles that of a man." "<b>The tunic.</b> This is its name; and when it is attached to another word — as in כְּתֹנֶת יוֹסֵף, כְּתֹנֶת פַּסִּים, כְּתֹנֶת בַּד — כְּתֹנֶת is punctuated with a dagesh."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:02:30.938688097Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}